bestloot3\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Cyclops%20Trophy\"><img alt=\"Cyclops Trophy\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cyclops_Trophy_9d3617.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Halberd\"><img alt=\"Halberd\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Halberd_2bb2ed.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dark%20Helmet\"><img alt=\"Dark Helmet\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dark_Helmet_9446d3.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Maps and Pictures</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"map\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Mistrock\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"104\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mistrock_29acab.png\" width=\"125\"/></span> </div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">8.40<br/>December 10, 2008<br/>Winter Update 2008</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><b>Mistrock</b> is one of the islands south-west of <a href=\"#/wiki/Yalahar\">Yalahar</a>. This island is a rocky tunneled hill infested with <a href=\"#/wiki/Cyclops\">cyclops</a>.  A sole <a href=\"#/wiki/Blood%20Crab\">Blood Crab</a> is on a beach in the north.  It is a good hunting place because the <a href=\"#/wiki/Cyclops\">Cyclops</a> drop large quantities of food and there is a <a href=\"#/wiki/Mailbox\">royal mailbox</a> near the boat. It can be reached via the NPC <a href=\"#/wiki/Maris\">Maris</a> who is located on the docks in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Foreigner%20Quarter\">Foreigner Quarter</a> of Yalahar\n</p><p>A good strategy for lower level players is to bring <a href=\"#/wiki/Stealth%20Ring\">Stealth Rings</a> with them so that they can hunt without having to worry about getting hit or swarmed.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Mistrock NPCs (1)</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\"></th><th style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Job</th><th style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\">Buy/Sell</th><th style=\"\">Location</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Maris\">Maris</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Maris\"><img alt=\"Maris\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Maris_d9d082.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Ship Captain</td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></td><td style=\"\">In the <a href=\"#/wiki/Foreigner%20Quarter\">Foreigner Quarter</a> all the way north-west in the harbour. Also on <a href=\"#/wiki/Fenrock\">Fenrock</a> and on <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Mistrock</strong>.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Mistrock Creatures</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Cyclops\"><img alt=\"Cyclops\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cyclops_9b3f34.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Cyclops\">Cyclops</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">150</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">260</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">105 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>0-47× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Meat\">Meat</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Short%20Sword\">Short Sword</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Cyclops Toe (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Plate Shield (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Battle Shield (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Heavy%20Old%2